# `agent-implement.yml`'s own prompt tells the implement agent never to edit
# `.github/workflows/**` for the same reason. Every commit on this branch that
# touched the workflow was pushed by a human.
#
# The fix below is written and verified locally: with it applied
# `node --test scripts/agent/checks.test.mjs` is 43/43, `make lint` is clean and
# `go test ./...` passes. Apply it and delete this file:
#
